      "prose": {
        "text": "I hold the position of **Fully remote**.\n\nOne reason is that **engineers who joined remote teams reached the same output as in-office joiners 5.5 months later**, indicating that the initial productivity gap between remote and in-office teams is relatively short-lived, and that remote teams can eventually catch up and even surpass in-office teams in terms of productivity.",
